  << /ActualText (Week 1 \024 Alignment \046 MVP Definition\n\nGoal\072 Everyone agrees on what you\031re building\nAll tracks\nAlign on\072\nMVP scope \050no extra features\051\nSingle user persona \050e\056g\056 \034career switcher in Germany\035\051\nDecide\072\nOne primary dataset \050ESCO or O\052NET \024 not both\051\nUX\nDefine\072\nPrimary user journey \050happy path\051\nKey emotional pain points \050confusion\054 overwhelm\051\nTech\nDecide stack\072\nFE \050React \057 Next\051\nBE \050FastAPI \057 Node\051\nAI \050Python\051\n\005 Deliverable\072\050 MVP scope doc \053 user journey \053 tech stack decision)
