  << /ActualText (User Interview 1 \024 Carol \050Career Switcher\054 From graphic designer to UX Design\051\nProfile\n Name\072 Carol \n Age\072 34\n Role\072 Graphic Designer\n Experience\072 8 years\n\nQ\072 How do you currently think about your career growth\077\nA\072Honestly\054 I think about it a lot\046 but I don\031t really know where to start\056 I feel like I should be doing something\054 but I\031m not sure what\056\nQ\072 What tools or platforms do you use\077\nA\072Mostly LinkedIn\054 sometimes YouTube\054 and I\031ve checked courses on Udemy\046 but it\031s too much\056 Everyone says something different\056\nQ\072 What frustrates you the most\077\nA\072There are too many options such as AI\054 UX\054 Visual design\054 Product management\046 I don\031t know what actually fits me\056 I don\031t want to waste time learning the wrong thing\056\035\nQ\072 Have you tried learning something new recently\077\nA\072 Yes\054 I started a UX design  course\054 but I stopped after a few weeks\056 It felt too overwhelmed\nQ\072 What would help you feel more confident\077\nA\072If I knew that my current skills actually connect to something\046 and if someone could tell me\072 this is the right path for you\056\nQ\072 How do you feel when thinking about your career\077\nA bit anxious\054 to be honest\056 Like I\031m falling behind\056\n\n)
     /K [ 190 ]
